title: Officers' Talk
subtitle: The fleet is restless.
tags: event
view-if: fear >= 60 and sec_leader_id = "tarkin" and navy_loyalty < 50 and not pal_chancellor and not puppet_chancellor and date >= 108 and not coup_warned and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 4
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: coup_warned = 1

= Officers' Talk

Fleet officers loyal to Wilhuff Tarkin have been meeting aboard a Star Destroyer above Eriadu. They talk about a Senate too weak to win the war, and about what disciplined men could do about it.

*With fear this high and the Navy's loyalty to the Senate this low, the Security Bloc could attempt a coup. A Navy at least 50% loyal, or a Senate Guard that answers to the Senate, would stop it.*

- @purge: Have the plotters reassigned.
- @reassure: Reassure the fleet.
- @ignore: Officers always talk.

@purge
view-if: chair_security = "rc" or rc_chancellor
subtitle: The Navy's loyalty to the Senate rises; the Security Bloc is furious.
on-arrival: navy_loyalty += 15; sec_relation -= 10; hawk_dissent += 3

The plotters find themselves commanding supply depots on the far side of the galaxy.

@reassure
subtitle: −1 political capital; the Navy's loyalty rises.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; navy_loyalty += 10

Caucus senators tour the fleet, promise new ships and better pay, and listen to the officers' complaints.

@ignore

Officers always talk.
